      "message": "[error] Line 734: 🔴 `target.empty()` is used as the failure sentinel, but a valid checkpoint can legitimately contain an empty document. That makes restore of an empty historical version dependent on history lookup and still leaves `collaborativeDocumentTextAt()` unable to distinguish unknown commits from empty content. Return an explicit success flag/optional from the snapshot path and use that for both browse and restore.",
