      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 403: 🔴 `textSplice()` compares suffix bytes after backing up the prefix to a UTF-8 boundary, but it does not ensure the suffix boundary is valid for both strings. With multi-byte characters, `insert.assign(to, prefix, to.size() - prefix - suffix)` can start or end inside a code point, producing invalid UTF-8 and potentially invalid Yjs text updates. Compute prefix/suffix on decoded code points or explicitly adjust both `from` and `to` boundaries before deriving UTF-16 offsets and inserted bytes.",
